## Progress Log Format

After every meaningful step, append to `docs/develop/AGENT_PROGRESS.md`:

```md
## <YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm> — Sprint <n>, Batch <n>

Status: DONE | IN_PROGRESS | BLOCKED | PAUSED

Completed:
- ...

Files changed:
- ...

Verification:
- pnpm typecheck: pass/fail/not run
- pnpm lint: pass/fail/not run
- pnpm test: pass/fail/not run
- pnpm test:e2e: pass/fail/not run
- pnpm build: pass/fail/not run

Blockers:
- ...

Next:
- ...
```

Do not exaggerate progress. Do not mark incomplete work as DONE.
